   "rot": 0,
   "label": "",
   "showLabel": false,
   "labelPos": "b",
   "params": {
    "text": "**Delay line** — lengthen one arm mechanically. Half a wavelength (0.000266 mm at 532 nm) swaps the outputs; a full wavelength brings them back. Set Motion to Periodic sweep to walk through the fringes instead.",
    "fontSize": 13,
    "fill": "#333333"
   }
